AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.SessionCommandFacade -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.BridgeService <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 1: Persist desired Stopped; begin orderly stop
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.BridgeService -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 2: Close admission and listener; finish/cancel owned work within deadline
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.BridgeService -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 3: Close ARC listener, watches and logical input leases
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.BridgeService -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.CallbackBroker <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 4: Suppress delivery; persist only recorded verified cleanup obligations
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.BridgeService -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.SqliteStoreCoordinator <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 5: Drain committed writer work and close coordinator
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.BridgeService -> AndroidOSandtargetapps <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 6: Publish Stopped, stopForeground and service; no automatic restart

